# Testing

A successful build is not enough for a page change. Open the page, use the link or control, and check the phone width.

Look for a broken app link, a dead route, a console error, and a layout that hides the heading or the next step.

Say what you actually opened. Do not mark a browser check as done if you only read the file.

The blog checklist still applies to articles. Separate checks you performed from checks you did not.

Do not publish, deploy, or regenerate approved audio unless the founder asked.
